        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4311, Ribbon Grab Orleans Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA lovely, classically styled entrance set, the Orleans Handleset has a stately manor, just like the city that is its namesake. The handle itself is pillar shaped, granting the otherwise simple piece a grandeur that borders on exaltedness. Made out of solid brass, it will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. This Ribbon Grab Orleans Entry Door Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Orleans Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Orleans Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Diameter: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4311-specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek 4311 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4311-finish.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Orleans Handleset",
                "description": "A lovely, classically styled entrance set, the Orleans Handleset has a stately manor, just like the city that is its namesake. The handle itself is pillar shaped, granting the otherwise simple piece a grandeur that borders on exaltedness. Made out of solid brass, it will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. This Ribbon Grab Orleans Entry Door Handleset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Orleans Tubular Handlesets, Emtek Orleans Entrance Handlesets, Ribbon Grab Orleans Entry Door Handlesets, Orleans Handlesets, Emtek 4311, Emtek 4321, Emtek 4301, EMT-4311, traditional Handlesets, classic Handlesets,"
            },
